OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FNew technology has helped officers at
OL,7,Fthe UK's biggest police force crack
OL,8,Fdown on shoplifting in London, the
OL,9,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,11,FThe new system, which has been piloted
OL,12,Fin six boroughs in the capital, allows
OL,13,Fretailers to submit CCTV footage,
OL,14,Fwitness statements and other evidence
OL,15,Fdirectly to officers, the force said.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/8
