OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FThe software has helped detectives
OL,7,Ftrack, arrest and build cases against
OL,8,Foffenders more quickly, as officers
OL,9,Fwho used to have to wait up to 28 days
OL,10,F` or even longer ` for CCTV footage
OL,11,Fcan now get it in minutes.
OL,13,FScotland Yard said the tech is being
OL,14,Fused by retail giants including Tesco,
OL,15,FBoots, Marks & Spencer and Greggs `
OL,16,Fwhose bosses have spoken out about the
OL,17,Fimpact of the surge in retail crime on
OL,18,Ftheir businesses.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/8
