CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FIn recent cases in the capital, a
OL,7,Fteenage boy went on a shoplifting
OL,8,Fspree worth more than #100,000 at
OL,9,FBoots and Holland and Barrett. He was
OL,10,Fspared jail by a magistrate at
OL,11,FHighbury Corner Youth Court in May,
OL,12,Fwhen he was told to seize the
OL,13,Fopportunity to turn his life around.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
