PN,37904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FIn June, Michael Belgrave, 55, of no
OL,7,Ffixed address, was sentenced at Ealing
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court to nine months
OL,9,Fimprisonment and made subject to a
OL,10,Ffive-year criminal behaviour order
OL,11,F(CBO), the Met said, after stealing
OL,12,Fmore than #4,000 worth of goods from
OL,13,Fshops including Greggs and BP.
OL,15,FThe five-year CBO bans him from
OL,16,Fentering any branch of Holland and
OL,17,FBarrett, Greggs or BP across England
OL,18,Fand Wales.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
