FL,380,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FThe Met said that when the new system
OL,7,Fwas used, there was a caution, charge
OL,8,For other criminal disposal in 29.4% of
OL,9,Fcases ` compared with the average of
OL,10,F7.3% before it was introduced.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FChief Inspector Rav Pathania, the
OL,18,FMet's lead for business crime, said
OL,19,Fthe tool is helping the force identify
OL,20,Fshoplifters more quickly and bring
OL,21,Fmore of them to justice.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
