FL,380,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,F"Tackling retail crime remains a top
OL,7,Fpriority for the Met," said Mr
OL,8,FPathania.
OL,10,F"Reported shoplifting offences across
OL,11,FLondon are down by almost 4%, but
OL,12,Fwe're not taking our foot off the
OL,13,Fpedal as evidenced by this continued
OL,14,Fuse of new tech.
OL,16,F"Shoplifters should be under no
OL,17,Fillusion ` we are increasing our
OL,18,Fcapability to catch you and put you
OL,19,Fbefore the courts."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@VO]rD@AOUxD@AOU{D@SO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/8
