OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,380,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FThe platform is currently being used
OL,7,Fby subscribing retailers in
OL,8,FWestminster, Kensington and Chelsea,
OL,9,FHammersmith and Fulham, Lewisham,
OL,10,FGreenwich and Bexley.
OL,12,FFrom Tuesday, the force will expand it
OL,13,Fto retailers in Southwark, Lambeth,
OL,14,FSutton, Croydon, Bromley, Hillingdon,
OL,15,FEaling and Hounslow.
OL,17,FJulie Murphy, vice president for
OL,18,FBoots' London and travel division,
OL,19,Fsaid the health and beauty giant was
OL,20,Fcommitted to partnering with the force
OL,21,Fto tackle retail crime.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
