OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,380,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1786024093
OL,3,CHow new tech is helping the Met Police
OL,4,Ccrack down on shoplifting
OL,6,FShe said: "The results published by
OL,7,Fthe Met today show that we are making
OL,8,Fprogress in bearing down on shop
OL,9,Ftheft, and Boots is pleased to be
OL,10,Fsupporting the roll-out of direct to
OL,11,Fpolice reporting via the platform to a
OL,12,Ffurther eight London boroughs."
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@_O]
